<scheme version="2.0" title="Lab 4 - Regression Analysis (HDI)" description="Predicts the Human Development Index with linear regression (plain, Lasso, Elastic Net), looks at the coefficients, and compares AdaBoost, Random Forest, Neural Network and kNN.">
